Hello Jamie,

I have run into this same error. For me it seems to occur during the hinge (H_1) model being tested. My settings were as follows:

Features Classes: L, LQ, H, and LQH
Regulation Multipliers: 1-5
Multiplier step value: 1
Clamping Off

Best,

Amanda Mancini

